        "1",
        "2",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    "long_instructions": "##Add Details to a Prompt\r\n\r\nA prompt with more details makes a better page.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Tap each chip and choose a detail to add to the prompt.\r\n2. Watch the sample page. What changes?\r\n3. Try other choices. Tap a choice again to take it out.\r\n\r\n**Notice & Discuss:**\r\n\r\n- What did the page look like with no details? With all four?\r\n- Which details would you include in your own prompt?",
